comment11.target=void\ moveToHospital(Animal)
comment11.text=\r\n\ Moves\ an\ unhealthy\ animal\ from\ its\ enclosure\r\n\ to\ the\ Hospital.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ animal\ unhealthy\ animal\r\n
