comment13.target=Enclosure\ findEnclosure(java.lang.String)
comment13.text=\r\n\ Finds\ the\ enclosure\ corresponding\ to\ an\ animal\ type.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ type\ animal\ type\r\n\ @return\ matching\ enclosure\ or\ null\ if\ not\ found\r\n
