comment9.target=void\ treatAnimals()
comment9.text=\r\n\ Veterinarian\ treats\ all\ sick\ animals.\r\n\r\n\ Animals\ that\ recover\ are\ moved\ back\ to\ their\r\n\ normal\ enclosure.\r\n
